  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dafterfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AFTERFALL/MP_AFTERFALL_Header.webp\" width=\"2036\" height=\"748\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在《Afterfall》中，你將探索廢棄的城市、破敗的道路與遺忘的角落，尋找資源以度過每一天。食物匱乏，感染者無處不在，每次外出都可能帶來比預期更糟的結果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>需要伺服器嗎？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dfnaf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BisectHosting</span></a> 是遊玩此整合包的最佳選擇。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dafterfall\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AFTERFALL/MP_AFTERFALL_Promo.webp\" width=\"2036\" height=\"302\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和朋友一起玩《Afterfall》會更有趣，但架設伺服器或處理延遲問題可能會很煩人。我一直使用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dafterfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>，因為它穩定順暢且開箱即用。如果你想試試看，可以使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dafterfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>這個連結</strong></span></a> 在第一個月享受 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AFTERFALL/MP_AFTERFALL_Description.webp\" width=\"2036\" height=\"202\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Afterfall》旨在提供更沉浸且具挑戰性的生存體驗，專注於探索、搜刮、戰鬥，以及在被毀壞的世界中持續求生的緊張感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">進度推進緩慢但回報豐厚。你將從幾乎一無所有開始，逐步打造更好的裝備、建立安全的庇護所，並學習如何在日益危險的世界中生存。夜晚變得更加致命，在不當的時機發出太大聲響可能會招致超出你應對能力的麻煩。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AFTERFALL/MP_AFTERFALL_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"2036\" height=\"201\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1689/108/afterfall-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2036\" height=\"1145\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1689/78/afterfall-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></span></p>",
